    text:
      "A contemporary California luxury villa featuring ultra-slim aluminum folding door systems designed for expansive indoor-outdoor living. The large-opening configuration seamlessly connects the minimalist interior with the outdoor terrace and pool area, creating uninterrupted panoramic views and refined architectural lines.",
    label: "Villa",
    image: "/images/optimized/california-luxury-villa-minimal-frame-folding-doors.webp",
    alt: "California luxury villa with minimal frame LIKI folding doors"
  },
  {
    loc: "Florida",
